  "goodToKnow": "Essbar means edible: essbare Pilze, essbare Blüten, gerade noch essbar. Pilze sammeln (mushroom picking) is a popular autumn pastime in Germany, and Pilzsachverständige (mushroom advisers) check finds for safety. The opposite is ungenießbar or giftig (poisonous). The suffix -bar means -able: trinkbar, machbar, lesbar."
